## Desktop

XFCE runs on display `:1` and is shared: never start a second desktop session.
`box exec COMMAND ...` runs a command with that display, its Xauthority and the
tool PATH; `box desktop` takes screenshots and sends input, and `box mcp` offers
the same as MCP tools.
Details: `/etc/rookery/guides/desktop.md`.

Graphics: {% if rookery_software_rendering %}CPU rendering (Mesa llvmpipe for OpenGL, lavapipe for Vulkan); there is no GPU acceleration.{% else %}the host's GPU where the driver allows it.{% endif %}
 Details: `/etc/rookery/guides/graphics.md`.

